# ===== Networking =====

# Auto-enable the networking stack when the devicetree contains an ethernet
# controller so ethernet boards don't need the boilerplate block in their
# board.conf (NETWORKING, NET_IPV4, NET_DHCPV4, NET_SOCKETS, NET_L2_ETHERNET,
# NET_MGMT_EVENT, NET_MGMT_EVENT_INFO and a bigger kernel heap). The DT_HAS_*
# symbols are generated by Zephyr from the devicetree bindings. Extend the
# list as new ethernet drivers/SoC families get ported; boards can still
# override any of these in board.conf.
config ZCP_ETHERNET_DT
